  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第三十二关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フロストリーフ",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "げほ、ごほっ……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "メテオリーテさん！　こちらで、スノーデビル小隊は退けました！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "ですが――"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フロストノヴァ",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "どうやら、私はお前たちを見くびっていたようだ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フロストノヴァ",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "この程度では足りないのなら、次の手を打つとしよう。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "（……もう、指先の感覚がない……）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "――これは……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "冷気が、集まっていく……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フロストノヴァ",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "こうなれば――"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フロストノヴァ",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "お前たちの幸運も、これ以上は続くまい。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "……！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "いけない……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "一帯の冷気を吸収して、一気に爆発させるつもりのようです！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フロストノヴァ",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "――♪――♬――"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "そんなアーツを使われたら、我々の体温も一瞬で奪われてしまうはず……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "先ほどのものと比べても、影響範囲が大きすぎて――"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フロストノヴァ",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "これで終わりだ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フロストノヴァ",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "純粋無垢なる氷霜で、お前たちの怒りまでもを埋葬してやろう。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "……くっ……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フロストノヴァ",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "……♪……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フロストノヴァ",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "……！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フロストノヴァ",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "なんだ？　冷気の流れを妨げているのは……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フロストリーフ",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "……ぐ、っ……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フロストノヴァ",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "これは、お前の仕業か？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フロストリーフ",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "言ったはず、だろう……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フロストリーフ",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "これ以上……進ませるわけにはいかない、と……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フロストノヴァ",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "――死力を尽くしてアーツを用い、気流を止めたというわけか。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フロストノヴァ",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "……本当に、大した子供だ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "あの、氷の刃は……フロストリーフさんのアーツ！　冷気の流れを分断してくれたんですね！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "けれど……彼女自身、限界が近付いているはず……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "この状態も長くは持ちません……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メテオリーテ",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "……だけど、これで十分よ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メテオリーテ",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "最後のチャンス――絶対、ものにしてみせる！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メテオリーテ",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "行くわよ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メテオリーテ",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "アーミヤ、援護をお願い！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "はい！　どうかお気をつけて！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メテオリーテ",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "ええ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "みなさん、援護射撃を始めてください！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "メテオリーテさん、お願いします！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メテオリーテ",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "任せてちょうだい……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レユニオン構成員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "なんだ……？　こっちに敵が突っ込んでき……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レユニオン構成員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "っ！　違う！　あいつ、フロストノヴァのほうへ向かってるぞ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レユニオン構成員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "い、行かせてたまるか！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レユニオン構成員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "撃て！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メテオリーテ",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "ッ……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "メテオリーテさん！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メテオリーテ",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "大丈夫！　直撃は食らってないわ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レユニオン構成員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "ま、まだ走れるのかよ……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レユニオン構成員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "クソッ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レユニオン構成員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "スノーデビルたちには近付かせねえぞ……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レユニオン構成員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "撃て、撃てっ！　奴にチャンスを与えるな！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メテオリーテ",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "――っ、あ……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メテオリーテ",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "ぐ……っ……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ジェシカ",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "ダメ……！　メテオリーテさん！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メテオリーテ",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "……このくらい……かすり傷よ！　こんなものじゃ、私は止められないんだから！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "このままでは……！　何か、私にできることは……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フロストノヴァ",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "うっ……ごほ、っ……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "――！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "（今……冷気が揺らいだ？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "もしかして、この冷気を止めるヒントが……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "――――！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "この感覚は……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "まさか――"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "ううん。とにかく今は、試してみなくちゃ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "――お願い、当たって！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "みんなが……私を信じてくれてるんだから！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レユニオン構成員",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "――――！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レユニオン構成員",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "クソッ……！　今のは、あのウサギのアーツか？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レユニオン構成員",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "俺たちの埋めた源石が、砕かれてるぞ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レユニオン構成員",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "――！　霧が……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "思った通り！　フロストノヴァは、レユニオンが埋めた源石を頼りにあの寒波を……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "――メテオリーテさん！！　今です！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メテオリーテ",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "フロストリーフ……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メテオリーテ",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
